<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <title>Welcome to NGECP</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f0fdf4; color: #1e293b; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
    <!-- Outer Wrapper Table -->
    <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f0fdf4; table-layout: fixed;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 10px;">
          <!-- Main Email Container -->
          <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width: 580px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #d1fae5; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.06); overflow: hidden;">
            
            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="background: #059669; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #047857 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 42px 24px 38px; border-bottom: 3px solid #047857;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d1fae5;">
                  NGECP Platform
                </p>
                <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; margin: 0 auto 18px auto; border-radius: 50%; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); color: #ffffff; font-size: 26px; line-height: 56px; text-align: center;">
                  ✓
                </div>
                <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; color: #ffffff;">
                  Welcome aboard, <%= user.name %>!
                </h1>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #d1fae5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
                  Your account has been successfully verified.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Body -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 42px 36px 36px;">
                <p style="font-size: 17px; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-weight: 600;">
                  Hello <strong><%= user.name %></strong>,
                </p>

                <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #334155; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
                  Your email has been verified and your 
                  <strong style="color: #065f46;">NGECP</strong> account is officially ready. We are glad to have you join our national compliance network.
                </p>

                <!-- Highlight Box -->
                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin: 28px 0; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-left: 4px solid #059669; border-radius: 10px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 20px 24px;">
                      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #475569;">
                        The National Generator Emission Control Program (NGECP) is designed to streamline generator monitoring, inspection workflows, and environmental standard compliance across enterprise networks.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Features List -->
                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin: 30px 0;">
                  
                  <!-- Feature 1 -->
                  <tr>
                    <td width="40" valign="top" style="padding-right: 14px; padding-bottom: 18px;">
                      <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="center" valign="middle" width="30" height="30" bgcolor="#ecfdf5" style="border-radius: 8px; color: #059669; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;">
                            ✓
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding-bottom: 18px;">
                      <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">
                        Manage Generator Infrastructure
                      </p>
                      <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;">
                        Register assets, track unit locations, and maintain complete hardware profile directories.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                  <!-- Feature 2 -->
                  <tr>
                    <td width="40" valign="top" style="padding-right: 14px; padding-bottom: 18px;">
                      <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="center" valign="middle" width="30" height="30" bgcolor="#ecfdf5" style="border-radius: 8px; color: #059669; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;">
                            📊
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding-bottom: 18px;">
                      <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">
                        Emissions & Compliance Reports
                      </p>
                      <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;">
                        Review multi-step diagnostic assessments, emissions levels, and safety scores in real time.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                  <!-- Feature 3 -->
                  <tr>
                    <td width="40" valign="top" style="padding-right: 14px;">
                      <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="center" valign="middle" width="30" height="30" bgcolor="#ecfdf5" style="border-radius: 8px; color: #059669; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;">
                            ↗
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top">
                      <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">
                        Automated Invoicing & Tracking
                      </p>
                      <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;">
                        Handle compliance statements, financial bills, and operational renewals effortlessly.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                </table>

                <!-- Call to Action Button (Bulletproof for Outlook) -->
                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding: 10px 0 24px 0;">
                      <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="center" bgcolor="#059669" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                            <a href="<%= siteUrl %>" target="_blank" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #059669; display: inline-block; background-color: #059669;">
                              Access NGECP Dashboard
                            </a>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="height: 1px; background-color: #e2e8f0; margin: 30px 0;"></td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin: 24px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                  Here's to optimized operations, strict environmental standards, and complete operational transparency.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="background-color: #f8fafc; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; padding: 28px 24px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                  Need assistance? Contact our support team at 
                  <a href="mailto:support@ngecp.com" style="color: #059669; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">support@ngecp.com</a>
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px;">
                  &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> NGECP. All rights reserved.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>